    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14755" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀργεῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>from Argos, Argive</i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀργεῖοι</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχαιοί</span>
			, for <i>the Greeks</i> in general:—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Ἀργεία</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>) <i>Argolis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.27
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργεῖαι, αἱ,</span>
			<i>women's shoes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργεῖος</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόλος</span>(, ὁ, name
			of a <i>throw at dice,</i> Id.</div>
